    "text": "<p>Sulphide ion is soft base and its ores are common for metals</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Pb</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Al</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Ag</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Mg</mi></math></p><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given&nbsp;below&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"
